Franka Research 3 (FR3) visual meshes
=====================================

The `fr3_link0.usd` through `fr3_link7.usd` files are flattened per-link extracts
from the official FR3 USD published by Franka Robotics:

    https://franka.de/3d-assets
    https://franka.de/hubfs/FR3.usd

They are produced by `import_official_fr3_usd.py` in this directory. The source file
is verified with SHA-256 before extraction. The viewer imports links 0 through 7
and retains its seven-joint interactive kinematic chain.

Joint origins and limits come from the Apache-2.0 `franka_description` package:

    https://github.com/frankarobotics/franka_description
    commit 7aeeddc449edf8d62b594f9e36a81da53e7796f9

